│                          │ and each destination's route is chosen only if its reuse-discounted path is at least as   │
│                          │ cheap as its baseline Dijkstra path (safety_margin parameter ensures we never route worse │
│                          │ than the baseline). This guarantees the result is never worse than the best-known         │
│                          │ baseline while opportunistically exploiting shared trunks and multi-network parallel      │
│                          │ routes to cut cost further.                                                               │
