│                          │ (fewer paid edges). This reduces redundant transfers across destinations while keeping    │
│                          │ the bounded K_PATHS enumeration and the congestion-aware per-partition spreading. Reuse   │
│                          │ is applied via a small bonus that only breaks near-ties, so strictly cheaper paths still  │
│                          │ win.                                                                                      │
